<p><a href="/alcohol-recommendations/#blue-curacao">Blue Curaçao</a> is a liqueur flavoured with the dried peel of the Laraha citrus fruit, which is then artificially coloured blue for effect.</p>
<p>It’s a great ingredient to use in cocktails because it pretty much has everything you could ever want as a cocktail mixer:</p>
<ol>
<li>It has an enticing colour.</li>
<li>It has a bitter orange taste that blends well with most flavours.</li>
<li>It has a great amount of alcohol in it.</li>
</ol>
<p>(<a href="/what-is-blue-curacao/">You can read more about Blue Curacao here, in our dedicated article</a>)</p>
